### 1. Valid configuration (有效配置验证)
POST http://localhost:25560/api/v1/projects/2/configuration/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "yaml": "version: 1\n\nproject:\n  name: test\n  species: mouse\n\nworkflow:\n  steps:\n    - prepare\n    - experiment\n\noutput:\n  format: json\n  path: ./output"
}

### 2. Invalid configuration (非法配置验证 - 预期返回版本不支持的错误)
POST http://localhost:25560/api/v1/projects/2/configuration/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "yaml": "version: 999\n\nproject:\n  name: test"
}

### 1. Valid configuration update (正常配置更新 - 预期返回 200 并在控制台打印 Git Commit)
PUT http://localhost:25560/api/v1/projects/2/configuration
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "yaml": "version: 1\n\nproject:\n  name: updated\n  species: mouse\n\nworkflow:\n  steps:\n    - prepare\n    - experiment\n\noutput:\n  format: json\n  path: ./output"
}

### 2. Invalid configuration update (错误配置更新 - 预期返回 400 且配置不入库、无 Git 提交)
PUT http://localhost:25560/api/v1/projects/2/configuration
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "yaml": "version: 999\n\nproject:\n  name: test"
}

